GRAMMAR.md §7.1: studio names a package no file declares.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  studio: studio.vocab
}
-- studio/studio.canon --
package studio
-- findings.txt --
error[E1012]  project.canon:3:11
  studio package "studio.vocab" does not exist

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
